DESCRIPTION                   = "This table contains mineral abundances and
 analytical errors derived from diffraction-all K-alpha diffraction data for
 the Mineral King drill sample, analyzed in CheMin cell number 2a (Kapton
 window). The analysis is based on RDA file
 CMB_762436550RDA41101060660CH00113P1. Mineral identifications, abundances
 and analytical errors for crystalline phases were determined using the
 program JADE. In a single night of analysis (15 minor frames) detection of
 phases at or near typical detection limits (~1%) is reduced; minor amounts
 of bassanite, goethite, and quartz may be present but were not confirmed.
 High intensity in the low 2-theta region and a broad amorphous hump were
 modeled using FULLPAT to indicate that ~50 +/- 25 weight% of the total
 sample consists of X-ray amorphous materials. All errors cited are 2-sigma.
 Column 1 of the table lists mineral identifications, column 2 lists the
 Mineral abundances in weight percent, and column 3 indicates the estimated
 analytical errors."
END_OBJECT                    = SPREADSHEET
END

